license: MIT
abstract: >-
  Reproducible computational research archive for Erdős Problem #409,
  including a complete certificate for F(6,668,696,999)=71, the nested
  F=68 through F=71 record chain, 222 recursive prime certificates,
  and an independently verified exact inverse-totient tree rooted at
  the earlier F=68 witness.
keywords:
  - Erdős Problem 409
  - Euler totient
  - iterated functions
  - inverse totient
  - computational number theory
  - primality certificates
  - reproducible research
